{"availability":"available","full":"Tappo-Tech/servio-v01","name":"servio-v01","description":"Smart Table Ordering & Real-Time Management SaaS for Cafes & Restaurants (QR/NFC Menu, Waiter Call, Order Tracking & Merchant Analytics)","category":"Other","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-02T02:22:21Z","updated":"2026-10-07T14:10:25Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://tappo-mvp.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://tappo-mvp.vercel.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T05:47:20.533Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T05:47:20.533Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T05:47:20.533Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T22:54:22.053Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-09T05:47:20.533Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["## Serve faster. Operate smarter. Grow with every table. SERVIO is a Saudi FoodTech platform that helps cafés and restaurants modernize table ordering and daily operations through QR-powered experiences.","SERVIO connects guests, service teams, and managers through QR-based table ordering, real-time operations, and practical business insights. A guest scans a table QR code, browses the menu, places an order, requests a waiter, and leaves feedback — without downloading an app. Managers and cashiers receive live updates through a focused Arabic-first dashboard built for hospitality operations.","Current focus: validating the need, demand, and market fit in Saudi Arabia before formal company registration and incubation applications."],"features":["Faster ordering: customers order directly from their table.","Better service: waiter calls and new orders reach the team in real time.","Clearer operations: managers and cashiers work from tenant-scoped dashboards.","More useful feedback: customer reviews are collected and surfaced to management.","Lower friction: no customer account or mobile app is required."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Tappo-Tech/servio-v0